"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Configuration\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"To see this module working, you need to create a view to see the\n"
"purchase order lines.\n"
"\n"
"You can do it by creating an action that open them and adding a menu\n"
"item to access.\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"To use this module, you need to:\n"
"\n"
"1. Go to the purchase order lines new view.\n"
"2. Select the lines that we want to reassign.\n"
"3. Press the action Reassign Lines to Other Purchase.\n"
"4. Select the destination purchase order.\n"
"\n"
"Bug Tracker\n"
"===========\n"
"\n"
"Bugs are tracked on `GitHub Issues <https://github.com/OCA/purchase-workflow/issues>`_.\n"
